# Site blocks

The 0.21.0 site pair: an opening-hours table the host stamps with its own
clock, and a decorative looping band.

::hours[title="Hours & Holidays" timezone="America/Los_Angeles"]
- Monday: 11am - 9pm
- Tuesday: 11am – 9pm
- Wednesday: Closed
- Thursday: 11:00 - 21:00
- Friday: 5pm - 2am
- Saturday: 5pm – 2am
- Sunday: 12pm - 6pm
::

::marquee
- Fresh <daily> & local
- Open late
- "Walk-ins welcome"
::
